=== METHOD NOTE F-SG129-2 (self-caught, corrected before verdict) ===
First G2 compare reported "CHANGED" (false): (a) the compare string included the `BEFORE`/`AFTER` tag field, so it could never be equal; (b) `printf '%s'` without a trailing newline made `while read` drop the last evidence (f9d71a40) in both captures, yielding 14 not 16 rows. Fixed by tag-stripping (`sed 's/^[^|]*|//'`) and `printf '%s\n'`; the rerun over 8 evidence produced `diff` exit 0. No status actually moved. Flagged because a wrong "CHANGED" would have been a false STOP, and the missed evidence would have been a partially-vacuous table.
